# Intel Agents — environment (optional)
#
# The run engine (run.py) drives Claude Code headless (`claude -p`), which
# authenticates itself — so NO API key is required.
#
# Optional: if the `claude` binary is not on PATH (e.g. under launchd's minimal
# environment) and not at ~/.local/bin/claude, point CLAUDE_BIN at it.
# The installed launchd plist already sets this.

# CLAUDE_BIN=/Users/you/.local/bin/claude
